@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

participant "command:AddActivityCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ModelManager" as Model MODEL_COLOR

[-> Command : execute(model)
note over Command
  Holds validated schedule details with a placeholder ID.
  Parsing has not consumed a persistent ID.
end note
Command -> Model : addActivity(name, date, start, end, recurrence)
note right of Model
  Assigns the next persistent activity ID.
  Adds the schedule with zero dogs.
end note
Model --> Command : addedActivity
note over Command
  Builds feedback with the assigned ID.
end note
[<-- Command : commandResult

legend bottom
  Adds an activity schedule. Model internals are omitted.
  Parsing and saving follow the shared Logic flow.
  Successful execution only; validation failures are omitted.
endlegend
@enduml
